            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Joseph Driscoll"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this tonight for dinner, but for a little healthier version I used organic maple syrup for a sweetener...then after I took it out of the oven and shredded the squash with a fork, I added a coat of Parmesan cheese, sliding it back in the oven until the cheese melted...really delicious.",
