            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mijadyco"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I do the sweet thing with acorn and butternut as well. I also choose the microwave over baking this type of squash. Saves a ton of time. I also add a dash of salt and cinnamon or pumpkin spice. This time around I halved the recipe to do sweet tonight and savory tomorrow night.",
            "datePublished": "2015-10-10T16:14:42.823Z"
          },
          {
