            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Josie Wilson McDade"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My new favorite!!! Had a huge spaghetti squash so I doubled the recipe and had to cook it longer and we loved it!!! I could have eaten the whole thing by myself if I didn't have to share it with everyone else. I liked mine with a bit of added salt but the kids loved as is!\n\nP.S. I started making this once and was then invited to the in-laws for dinner at the last minute so I put it in my slow cooker on low till we got home. It was still just as awesome!!!",
            "datePublished": "2014-11-16T16:17:24.693Z"
